 in vision a pillar of fire and reads from a book of prophecy—He praises God, foretells the coming of the Messiah, and prophesies the destruction of Jerusalem—He is persecuted by the Jews. About 600 B.C.","sm":"Ua amata e Nifae le talafaamaumau o lona nuu—Ua vaai Liae i se afi faaniutu i se faaaliga vaaia ma ua faitau mai i se tusi o valoaga—Ua viia e ia le Atua, valoia le afio mai o le Mesia, ma valoia le faafanoga o Ierusalema—Ua sauaina o ia e tagata Iutaia. E tusa o le 600 T.L.M.","words":[{"en":"·","sm":"Ua"},{"en":"begins","sm":"amata"},{"en":"·","sm":"e"},{"en":"Nephi","sm":"Nifae"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"the record","sm":"talafaamaumau"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"·","sm":"lona"},{"en":"of his people—","sm":"nuu—"},{"en":"·","sm":"Ua"},{"en":"sees","sm":"vaai"},{"en":"Lehi","sm":"Liae"},{"en":"·","sm":"i"},{"en":"·","sm":"se"},{"en":"·","sm":"afi"},{"en":"a pillar of fire","sm":"faaniutu"},{"en":"·","sm":"i"},{"en":"·","sm":"se"},{"en":"·","sm":"faaaliga"},{"en":"in a vision","sm":"vaaia"},{"en":"·","sm":"ma"},{"en":"·","sm":"ua"},{"en":"and reads","sm":"faitau"},{"en":"from","sm":"mai"},{"en":"·","sm":"i"},{"en":"·","sm":"se"},{"en":"a book","sm":"tusi"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"of prophecy—","sm":"valoaga—"},{"en":"·","sm":"Ua"},{"en":"·","sm":"viia"},{"en":"·","sm":"e"},{"en":"he praises","sm":"ia"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"God,","sm":"Atua,"},{"en":"foretells","sm":"valoia"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"·","sm":"afio"},{"en":"the coming","sm":"mai"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"of the Messiah,","sm":"Mesia,"},{"en":"·","sm":"ma"},{"en":"and prophesies","sm":"valoia"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"the destruction","sm":"faafanoga"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"of Jerusalem—","sm":"Ierusalema—"},{"en":"·","sm":"Ua"},{"en":"·","sm":"sauaina"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"he is persecuted","sm":"ia"},{"en":"·","sm":"e"},{"en":"·","sm":"tagata"},{"en":"by the Jews.","sm":"Iutaia."},{"en":"·","sm":"E"},{"en":"·","sm":"tusa"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"about","sm":"le"},{"en":"600","sm":"600"},{"en":"B.C.","sm":"T.L.M."}]},"num":1,"verses":[{"en":"I, Nephi, having been born of goodly parents, therefore I was taught somewhat in all the learning of my father; and having seen many afflictions in the course of my days, nevertheless, having been highly favored of the Lord in all my days; yea, having had a great knowledge of the goodness and the mysteries of God, therefore I make a record of my proceedings in my days.","n":1,"sm":"O a’u, o Nifae, na fanaua e matua lelei, o lea na aoaoina ai lava a’u i le poto uma o lo’u tamā; ma ona ua ou vaai i puapuaga e tele i le gasologa o o’u aso, ae ui i lea, sa alofagia tele a’u e le Alii i o’u aso uma; ioe, ona ua ou maua se malamalama tele o le agalelei ma mealilo a le Atua, o lea ou te faia ai se talafaamaumau o a’u taualumaga i o’u aso.","w":[{"en":"·","sm":"O"},{"en":"I,","sm":"a’u,"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"Nephi,","sm":"Nifae,"},{"en":"·","sm":"na"},{"en":"having been born","sm":"fanaua"},{"en":"·","sm":"e"},{"en":"·","sm":"matua"},{"en":"of goodly parents,","sm":"lelei,"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"therefore","sm":"lea"},{"en":"·","sm":"na"},{"en":"·","sm":"aoaoina"},{"en":"·","sm":"ai"},{"en":"·","sm":"lava"},{"en":"I was taught","sm":"a’u"},{"en":"·","sm":"i"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"·","sm":"poto"},{"en":"in all the learning","sm":"uma"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"·","sm":"lo’u"},{"en":"of my father;","sm":"tamā;"},{"en":"and","sm":"ma"},{"en":"·","sm":"ona"},{"en":"·","sm":"ua"},{"en":"·","sm":"ou"},{"en":"having seen","sm":"vaai"},{"en":"·","sm":"i"},{"en":"·","sm":"puapuaga"},{"en":"·","sm":"e"},{"en":"many afflictions","sm":"tele"},{"en":"·","sm":"i"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"in the course","sm":"gasologa"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"·","sm":"o’u"},{"en":"of my days,","sm":"aso,"},{"en":"·","sm":"ae"},{"en":"·","sm":"ui"},{"en":"·","sm":"i"},{"en":"nevertheless,","sm":"lea,"},{"en":"·","sm":"sa"},{"en":"·","sm":"alofagia"},{"en":"·","sm":"tele"},{"en":"I was highly favored","sm":"a’u"},{"en":"·","sm":"e"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"the Lord","sm":"Alii"},{"en":"·","sm":"i"},{"en":"·","sm":"o’u"},{"en":"·","sm":"aso"},{"en":"in all my days;","sm":"uma;"},{"en":"yea,","sm":"ioe,"},{"en":"·","sm":"ona"},{"en":"·","sm":"ua"},{"en":"·","sm":"ou"},{"en":"had","sm":"maua"},{"en":"·","sm":"se"},{"en":"·","sm":"malamalama"},{"en":"a great knowledge","sm":"tele"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"of the goodness","sm":"agalelei"},{"en":"and","sm":"ma"},{"en":"the mysteries","sm":"mealilo"},{"en":"·","sm":"a"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"of God,","sm":"Atua,"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"therefore","sm":"lea"},{"en":"·","sm":"ou"},{"en":"·","sm":"te"},{"en":"·","sm":"faia"},{"en":"I make","sm":"ai"},{"en":"·","sm":"se"},{"en":"a record","sm":"talafaamaumau"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"·","sm":"a’u"},{"en":"of my proceedings","sm":"taualumaga"},{"en":"·","sm":"i"},{"en":"·","sm":"o’u"},{"en":"in my days.","sm":"aso."}]},{"en":"Yea, I make a record in the language of my father, which consists of the learning of the Jews and the language of the Egyptians.","n":2,"sm":"Ioe, ou te faia se talafaamaumau i le gagana a lo’u tamā, ua faia i le poto o tagata Iutaia ma le gagana a tagata Aikupito.","w":[{"en":"yea,","sm":"Ioe,"},{"en":"·","sm":"ou"},{"en":"·","sm":"te"},{"en":"I make","sm":"faia"},{"en":"·","sm":"se"},{"en":"a record","sm":"talafaamaumau"},{"en":"·","sm":"i"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"in the language","sm":"gagana"},{"en":"·","sm":"a"},{"en":"·","sm":"lo’u"},{"en":"of my father,","sm":"tamā,"},{"en":"·","sm":"ua"},{"en":"which consists","sm":"faia"},{"en":"·","sm":"i"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"of the learning","sm":"poto"},{"en":"·","sm":"o"},{"en":"·","sm":"tagata"},{"en":"of the Jews","sm":"Iutaia"},{"en":"·","sm":"ma"},{"en":"·","sm":"le"},{"en":"and the language","sm":"gagana"},{"en":"·","sm":"a"},{"en":"·","sm":"tagata"},{"en":"of the Egyptians.","sm":"Aikupito."}]},{"en":"And I know